#23200
Sietch Tabr Credits room~
Most of this area is taken from Dune (the book) by
Frank Herbert.  It has been adapted to suit the environment
of RavenMUD.
~
232 1536 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#23201
&10Edge of the Great Erg&00~
A vast expanse of sand stretches as far as you can see.  The heat here is
unbelievable, you can literally feel the sun baking the moisture out of your
body.  The air is perfectly still, and all you can hear is your own breathing.
  
~
232 68 0 0 0 16 255 0
D0
~
~
0 0 23202
S
#23202
&10The Great Erg&00~
Your footprints fade away behind you.  A hot wind has come up, and tan dust
swirls around your ankles.  &14Sparks&00 flash over your armor and skin from
the static in the air.  You hear a dry rasping in the distance which makes your
skin crawl.    
~
232 512 0 0 0 0 255 0
D1
   The dunes continue as far as you can see, however the land seems far to flat
to be safe.  You get a terrible feeling in your soul about this....    
~
~
0 0 23203
D3
~
~
0 0 23204
S
#23203
&09A Tidal Dust Basin&00~
As soon as take your first step, you regret it.  You sink up to your hips in
tan colored dust the consistency of ground glass.  You attempt to turn around
and go back, but your feet sleep, and you slip below the surface.  Dust fills
your mouth and nose.  The dust swirls around you as you plummet to the bottom
of the chasm.  You hit bottom with a bone-jarring thump, involuntarily gasping,
and getting a lung full of the clinging dust.  Choking and gagging, you lose
consciousness.    
~
