#23216
&07A Water Reclamation Chamber&00~
As the door closes behind you, you realize that this must be where the fremen
reclaim the water from their dead.  You turn around to leave, but notice that
there is no handle on the inside.  A bright light blinds you, and you feel
incredible heat, as your body is drained of it's water.    
~
