#23217
&07The Entryway&00~
You follow the tunnel up steps, a turn, more steps, out of the tunnel into a
narrow passage with yellow rock walls and ceiling.  The air here is much
cooler, and you hear the people wandering about, hard at work surviving in this
hellish land.    
~
