#23218
&07A Large Kitchen&00~
Sinks, ovens, grills, and supply shelves dominate this kitchen.  Huge pots of
soup boil over a fire pit, and some unfortunate desert animal turns slowly on a
spit over a hot grill.  While the food smells wonderful, it all seems to be
saturated with melange.    
~
