&07Maud'Dib's Quarters&00~
This room is about 18 feet square.  Thick blue carpets cover the floor, sheets
of blue and green fabric hide stone walls.  You feel a slight breeze from an
air shaft cunningly concealed in a pattern of hangings directly in front of
you.    
