#23259
&07A Quiet Corridor&00~
The walls of this passage are smooth stone and the floor is cleanly swept.  
There is very little noise here, only muted rustling, and low whispers.  
Globes of light are mounted on the walls providing a dim yellow light.  There
is a simple stone arch to the east, while the corridor continues to the north
and south.    
~
