&07Lady Jessica's Quarters&00~
This place has thick rugs on the floor, soft cushions, a low coffee table at
the center of the room, and multicolored wall hangings cover the walls.  You
smell the rich aroma of spiced coffee, as well as an almost harsh melange odor.
  
