&07Otheym's Quarters&00~
This is quite obviously the sleeping quarters of a competent warrior.  Tokens
of battles long since won or lost cover the walls.  While fremen do not believe
in medals, these are more than likely the quarters of a high-ranking
lieutenant.    
~
